  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG-Australia Transport Sector Support Program (TSSP) Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&#x2019;s support to Papua New Guinea&#x2019;s (PNG) transport sector is delivered through the PNG-Australia Transport Sector Support Program (TSSP). TSSP commenced in 2007 and is now a 15-20 year commitment to support &#x2018;a more effective, efficient and inclusive transport system that supports the economic and social development of PNG&#x2019;. TSSP3 invests in quality safeguarded transport infrastructure, as well as capacity building and technical assistance for sector governance, strategic policy advice and direction, as well as financial and procurement oversight for the program. Gender equity, disability inclusion and climate resilience are integrated throughout program delivery and engagement. TSSP3 is currently scheduled to run until 2028. Sector split: Transport and Storage 100%</narrative>
  </description>
